        "value": "雜税米千四百九十六石四斗二升六合貳勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "雑税 米千四百九十六石四斗二升六合二勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Miscellaneous tax in rice = 1,496.4262 koku. The final sub-unit reads 貳勺 (formal 2, verified at 5-8x), NOT 四勺 as MASTER records: 正租米 10,232.56445 + this = 11,728.99065 vs the printed 米 total 11,728.9907 (~0.00005 = one 才 source-rounding gap); the 四勺 reading fits worse. Trust the scan."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "雜税"
      }
